    <div>
      <p begin="00:06.250" end="00:07.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't play with a girl, don't play with a girl)</p>
      <p begin="00:07.740" end="00:09.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't cook but I got good taste (taste)</p>
      <p begin="00:09.710" end="00:11.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't drive but I love the chase (chase)</p>
      <p begin="00:11.240" end="00:12.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Soft touch when I use my teeth (my teeth)</p>
      <p begin="00:12.910" end="00:14.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't play with a girl like me (like me)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.700" end="00:16.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stay close but I need my space (space)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.580" end="00:18.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One kiss that's all it takes (all it takes)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.580" end="00:20.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You're in way, way, way deep (way deep)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.420" end="00:22.760" ttm:agent="v1">Don't play with a girl, don't play with a girl like</p>
      <p begin="00:22.760" end="00:28.390" ttm:agent="v1">Me, me</p>
      <p begin="00:28.390" end="00:29.970" ttm:agent="v1">Don't play with a girl, don't play with a girl like</p>
      <p begin="00:29.970" end="00:35.820" ttm:agent="v1">Me, me</p>
      <p begin="00:35.820" end="00:37.350" ttm:agent="v1">Don't play with a girl, don't play with a girl like</p>
      <p begin="00:37.350" end="00:40.640" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, I see you, babe</p>
      <p begin="00:40.640" end="00:44.820" ttm:agent="v1">Don't do too much before the finish line</p>
      <p begin="00:44.820" end="00:48.280" ttm:agent="v1">It's true, I ain't no pick me</p>
      <p begin="00:48.280" end="00:52.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That's not how you're keeping my interest (ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:52.500" end="00:57.580" ttm:agent="v1">Came for the music, I stayed for you</p>
      <p begin="00:57.580" end="01:01.030" ttm:agent="v1">Here in this moment, I'm yours to lose</p>
      <p begin="01:01.030" end="01:03.170" ttm:agent="v1">When you do it do it right</p>
      <p begin="01:03.170" end="01:06.670" ttm:agent="v1">Take me by surprise, imagine being mine</p>
      <p begin="01:06.670" end="01:08.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't cook but I got good taste (taste)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.630" end="01:10.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't drive but I love the chase (chase)</p>
