      <p begin="01:14.050" end="01:16.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stay close but I need my space (space)</p>
      <p begin="01:16.010" end="01:17.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One kiss that's all it takes (all it takes)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.980" end="01:19.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You're in way, way, way deep (way deep)</p>
